{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499434",
      "title": "Dynamic Query Functions & Query Keys",
      "sourceHash": "bb2ddcb41b92996722e379f27e8c8a78c337ff458481b894a7d1a9bdef80a8ca",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "Now in this demo application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 4.83,
          "en": "which I prepared for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.83,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "there is not just the NewEventsSection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 10.15,
          "en": "but also this FindEventSection,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 14.04,
          "en": "which is still a section on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.04,
          "end": 18.27,
          "en": "It's this section down there where we have a search bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.27,
          "end": 20.85,
          "en": "And the goal of course here is to allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.85,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "to enter anything into that search bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 27.9,
          "en": "and then find events that meet our search criteria.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.9,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "So for example, events that contain the word city",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 32.793,
          "en": "in their title or description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "And for that I'll start by not throttling my network anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 41.58,
          "en": "so that we're not getting any strange behaviors here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.58,
          "end": 45.483,
          "en": "And we can now go to FindEventSection.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "Because in there at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "we of course have no logic for fetching any data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "We just have some logic for potentially getting data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 58.65,
          "en": "out of that input with help of that ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.65,
          "end": 61.68,
          "en": "and for handling the submission of this form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.68,
          "end": 63.73,
          "en": "But that's of course going to change now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 66.84,
          "en": "Because in this file we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "and should now also again import useQuery",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 75.783,
          "en": "to send another query with help of TanStack React Query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "So here we can then execute useQuery",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 84.21000000000001,
          "en": "and again of course configure it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.21000000000001,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "And we'll need a query function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "and as you learned before, also this query key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 90.363,
          "en": "This doesn't change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.8,
          "end": 93.42,
          "en": "Now for the function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 97.35,
          "en": "I still want to use this fetchEvents function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "but we now must be able to pass some extra data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.78,
          "en": "and we must tweak this code here a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.78,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "because now we must include this search term",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "which is entered here into this input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 113.973,
          "en": "into this request to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.38,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "And for this demo backend I am providing to you here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 122.82,
          "en": "you can simply incorporate this search result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 126.093,
          "en": "by adding a query parameter to this backend URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "The search query parameter, which should be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 133.113,
          "en": "to the search term that was entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.07999999999998,
          "en": "But of course this query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.07999999999998,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "should not always be added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "but instead only if a request is triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 142.893,
          "en": "from inside the FindEventSection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 148.92000000000002,
          "en": "So therefore, fetchEvents must get more flexible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 152.4,
          "en": "It should accept a searchTerm parameter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.4,
          "end": 154.68,
          "en": "as an input value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.68,
          "end": 157.2,
          "en": "And then in here in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.2,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "we can construct the backend URL dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 166.17000000000002,
          "en": "by always starting with this part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.17000000000002,
          "end": 171.17000000000002,
          "en": "but by then checking if searchTerm is not false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 175.98,
          "en": "So if it's set and not an empty string, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.98,
          "end": 180.98,
          "en": "And if that's the case, we want to add a string to this URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "And that string is that search query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 189.483,
          "en": "which is set equal to searchTerm like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "That's the goal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 197.853,
          "en": "And we can then use this URL here for this fetch function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.29,
          "end": 201.42000000000002,
          "en": "And that is all that must be done here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.42000000000002,
          "end": 203.16,
          "en": "in this fetchEvents function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 205.5,
          "en": "because with that we're now able to call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.5,
          "end": 208.98,
          "en": "without a search term and it will work as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.98,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "or with a search term and that search term will be forwarded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "to the backend, and the backend I'm providing to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "in this app.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 221.16,
          "en": "We'll then make sure to only provide results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.16,
          "end": 223.413,
          "en": "that match this search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.73,
          "end": 228,
          "en": "So now with this adjusted http.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "we can go back to the FindEventSection component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "and in there we can now continue configuring this query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 239.88,
          "en": "The query function is now again fetchEvents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.88,
          "end": 244.88,
          "en": "but we now actually must control how this will be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.13,
          "end": 249.11,
          "en": "to make sure that this search term that was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 249.11,
          "end": 253.233,
          "en": "in this input is forwarded to fetchEvents.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 258.81,
          "en": "And to do that, we can actually wrap this in a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.81,
          "end": 262.35,
          "en": "an anonymous arrow function here in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.35,
          "end": 265.2,
          "en": "and then pass the value that was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.2,
          "end": 268.183,
          "en": "into this input to fetchEvents.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 270.15,
          "end": 274.14,
          "en": "So we could say that here as a value for fetchEvents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.14,
          "end": 279.06,
          "en": "we wanna pass in searchElement.current.value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 279.06,
          "end": 281.67,
          "en": "since it's a ref that will be connected to this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 281.67,
          "end": 283.923,
          "en": "which will have such a value property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.88,
          "en": "But if we're doing that, we'll have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 287.88,
          "end": 292.88,
          "en": "that this query is not sent before we do have a search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.13,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "And we'll make sure that this is the case in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.94,
          "end": 298.29,
          "en": "Before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 298.29,
          "end": 301.293,
          "en": "I'll first of all set up the queryKey here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.19,
          "end": 305.28,
          "en": "And of course we also need to import fetchEvents.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.28,
          "end": 307.29,
          "en": "So we should import fetchEvents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 307.29,
          "end": 312.29,
          "en": "from going up, going up, util/http.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.64,
          "end": 316.05,
          "en": "And then of course as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.05,
          "end": 317.853,
          "en": "we should set up that queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.72,
          "end": 321.81,
          "en": "And here the queryKey should be events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.81,
          "end": 324.69,
          "en": "but it should be more than just that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.69,
          "end": 326.61,
          "en": "because this is now a query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.61,
          "end": 330.36,
          "en": "that does not have the goal of fetching all events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.36,
          "end": 334.053,
          "en": "but instead only events that match our search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 335.13,
          "end": 338.22,
          "en": "Now if we would use this queryKey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 338.22,
          "end": 341.1,
          "en": "we would of course be using the same queryKey",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.1,
          "end": 344.64,
          "en": "as in the NewEventsSection component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.64,
          "end": 349.08,
          "en": "There we currently have exactly the same queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.08,
          "end": 352.29,
          "en": "And as a result of using the same key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 352.29,
          "end": 355.62,
          "en": "React Query would actually use the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 355.62,
          "end": 360.18,
          "en": "from this first query in the NewEventsSection component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 360.18,
          "end": 363.6,
          "en": "in that other query in that other component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 363.6,
          "end": 367.11,
          "en": "because the results are cached, they are available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 367.11,
          "end": 369.6,
          "en": "and therefore they would be used here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.6,
          "end": 371.28,
          "en": "But that of course would be wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.28,
          "end": 374.58,
          "en": "because that would typically be too many results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.58,
          "end": 377.43,
          "en": "because typically we're searching for something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.43,
          "end": 381.183,
          "en": "that should only yield a couple of results, not all of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 382.08,
          "end": 384.39,
          "en": "So we need a different queryKey here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 384.39,
          "end": 388.38,
          "en": "so that this query works independently from this query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 388.38,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "And the results from this query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 390.09,
          "end": 394.2,
          "en": "in the NewEventsSection component are not used as results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.2,
          "end": 397.203,
          "en": "for this query in the FindEventSection component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 398.67,
          "end": 401.1,
          "en": "Therefore here we should also include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 401.1,
          "end": 404.787,
          "en": "some other piece of information in that queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 404.787,
          "end": 408.81,
          "en": "And that other piece of information should be dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 408.81,
          "end": 411.18,
          "en": "because it should be that search term",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 411.18,
          "end": 412.443,
          "en": "for which we're looking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 417.78,
          "en": "So we could, for example, pass an object here to this key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.78,
          "end": 419.67,
          "en": "where we have a search property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 419.67,
          "end": 423.18,
          "en": "and then our dynamic search term as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 423.18,
          "end": 426.27,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could also just pass our searchTerm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 426.27,
          "end": 428.52,
          "en": "as a dynamic value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 428.52,
          "end": 432.84,
          "en": "This is up to you, but here I'll go for this extra object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 432.84,
          "end": 436.71,
          "en": "to make it very clear which kind of other value we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 436.71,
          "end": 438.063,
          "en": "in this queryKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 439.5,
          "end": 442.83,
          "en": "And of course here we could again use this ref value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 442.83,
          "end": 447.48,
          "en": "But using this ref value for fetchEvents and for this key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 447.48,
          "end": 452.48,
          "en": "is actually not ideal, because refs, unlike state in React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 453.36,
          "end": 456.7,
          "en": "don't cause this component function to re-execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 457.65,
          "end": 460.02,
          "en": "which means that as the value entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 460.02,
          "end": 462.24,
          "en": "into this input here changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 462.24,
          "end": 466.44,
          "en": "this query is not updated and not sent again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 466.44,
          "end": 470.73,
          "en": "But of course we would wanna send it again to get new data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 470.73,
          "end": 473.913,
          "en": "if the user did enter a different search term.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 475.17,
          "end": 477.36,
          "en": "Therefore, here in this component",
