        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 489.96,
          "end": 494.04,
          "en": "and a setSearchTerm state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 494.04,
          "end": 498.37,
          "en": "And my goal in handleSubmit is now to call setSearchTerm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 500.52,
